{"3690320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Earth Fighter", "steam_appid": 3690320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>THE LAST EARTH FIGHTER </strong>🎮</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN ATMOSPHERIC CINEMATIC SHOOT 'EM UP GAME...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The last defender of Earth… but sometimes, hiding is wiser than shooting.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹<strong>📌 Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 <strong>Six unique environments</strong>, each with its own gameplay twist — from deep space and scorching deserts to underwater worlds and humanity's shattered remains.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Reflexes meet strategy</strong> — dodge, hide, time your movements, solve environmental puzzles, and find your path through danger.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Dynamic level design</strong> — from narrow laser corridors to falling boulders and shifting cave systems, every chapter tests a different skill.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 <strong>A story of survival and resistance</strong> — be the last hope of a dying Earth and confront the alien force that brought humanity to its knees.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 <strong>Immersive soundtrack and ambient audio</strong> — tailored to each environment to heighten tension and atmosphere.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>An epic finale</strong> — destroy the alien energy core and end the invasion once and for all.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎬 <strong>Enjoy cinematic sequences between levels</strong> – dive deeper into the story as you progress through each unique world.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🚀 Drift through the silent void of deep space, dodging meteors and unseen threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/ec3d4a0085642124c158f2b83b50d3af.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☁️ Lose yourself in endless cloud seas where enemies vanish into mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/184abd4c1bc867d4fd07483b759099c4.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏜️ Cross abandoned deserts, where the wind whispers of battles long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/39b86f756d81b76719bea570acc1254f.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Sink into the dark, cold depths of underwater worlds, where danger waits in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/668b15696238f689a943677e38e3af27.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 Navigate the claustrophobic echoes of forgotten caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/95aa1e6eb49d9bacabc25463135a63d2.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ Rise above the shattered mega-cities for the ultimate showdown — Earth's final stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/c765b062390b4c81feead8fd10fdd15e.avif?t=1749023742\" width=798 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>IN GAME ACHIEVEMENTS </strong> - <strong>Track Your Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras/f9c5c9384fbfe3ba12a3ec659ce77fbd.avif?t=1749023742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690320/extras_big/f9c5c9384fbfe3ba12a3ec659ce77fbd.avif?t=1749023742 width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the unknown across the stars and earth? Unlock unique achievements as you battle your way through waves of alien threats and uncover deep mysteries:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Contact</strong> – Kill the first enemy wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Contact</strong> – Destroy rotating enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien in Space</strong> – Successful contact with alien lifeforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Balloons</strong>- Puncture 28 Space Balloons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOs in the Clouds</strong> – UFOs have been destroyed in the clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisible UFOs</strong> – Stealth UFOs taken down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumping Robots Seen</strong> – Banished the jumping robots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain Guardians</strong> – The mountain guardians were defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Underwater Enemies</strong> – Submarines were sunk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact with Submarines</strong> – Submarines eliminated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Detected</strong> – The Metroidvania threat was neutralized.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mines Are Everywhere</strong> – Cleared the field of mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cave Has Echoes</strong> – Enhanced the cave’s mysterious echoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers Are Following Us</strong> – All towers have collapsed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passed Through the Metropolis</strong> – Reclaimed the city from alien forces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your achievements anytime and start fresh on your journey through the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A PERFECT GAME FOR YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six difficulty level, pick ups, auto fire, and other accessibility options, you'll be able to enjoy a relaxing exploration experience or a punishing Bullet Hell session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is waiting for you...</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>THE LAST EARTH FIGHTER </strong>🎮</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN ATMOSPHERIC CINEMATIC SHOOT 'EM UP GAME...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The last defender of Earth… but sometimes, hiding is wiser than shooting.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹<strong>📌 Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 <strong>Six unique environments</strong>, each with its own gameplay twist — from deep space and scorching deserts to underwater worlds and humanity's shattered remains.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Reflexes meet strategy</strong> — dodge, hide, time your movements, solve environmental puzzles, and find your path through danger.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Dynamic level design</strong> — from narrow laser corridors to falling boulders and shifting cave systems, every chapter tests a different skill.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 <strong>A story of survival and resistance</strong> 